gitfetcher CLI API

There are 2 modes of running:

* As a mirror server: all repos will be mirrors. In this case, all
  repositories should have core.bare = true and core.mirror = true. Each
  fetch will overwrite any local refs.

* In a normal dev environment, to update many repositories at once. In
  this case the fetch will not touch the working directory.

The default command should be fetch.
